This repository contains scripts and data used to preprocess predictors and calculate the response variable, "Yield Gap Trend." 
The work focuses on estimating various forms of capital and diversity indices to support the analysis.

Scripts
script_response_and_predictors.py:
Focuses on natural capital based on major crops. Includes estimations for human, physical, financial, and socio-political capitals.
script_predictors2.py:Expand s on natural capital estimations by considering all crops.
